  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "切、煮、烤、炸等短烹饪小游戏会把食材做成战斗生物，每轮还能新增队员或进化已有斗士。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Chop, boil, bake and fry your ingredients into fighting shape in a snappy series of bite-sized minigames. Each round is a chance to add to your team or evolve your existing fighters into new, more powerful evolutions!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "最多6对6的回合战中，可从六十五种手绘食物斗士的能力和协同中编排组合，并加入厨师力量与调味料变化。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Once you're plated up, command your culinary creations in up-to-6v6 turn-based battles! Cook up your own strategies and combos from 65+ lovingly hand-animated GladiEATers unique sets of abilities and synergies. Unlock Combat Chef powers and seasonings for an extra twist.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "七段关于烹饪、冲突与共情的厨师故事汇聚到CALosseum，让角色解决旧怨并建立关系。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Seven stories of cooking, conflict, and compassion all lead to the CALosseum: A pun-flinging egg farmer, a monolingual Finnish baker (and his best friend) and at least one secret agent will prove themselves, settle old scores, and maybe even make a few friends along the way.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
